    <div class="secthead">
      <h2 style="margin:0">{{ t('Seasonality mosaic — mean return × hit-rate by month', '季节性矩阵 — 各月平均回报 × 命中率') }}
        {{ help("A factor × calendar-month grid. The big number is that month's average factor return across all years (green = positive, red = negative; deeper = larger); the small number is the hit-rate (% of years that month was positive). Hover any cell for mean, median, hit-rate and sample size. The current month column is outlined. Median + hit-rate matter because a single crisis month can swing a 30-year average.", '因子 × 日历月份网格。大数为该月历年平均因子回报（绿=正、红=负；越深越大）；小数为命中率（该月为正的年份比例）。悬停查看均值、中位数、命中率与样本量。当前月份列已描边。中位数与命中率很重要，因为单个危机月可大幅扭曲 30 年均值。') }}
      </h2>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <span class="seg" id="winseg">
        <button data-win="full" class="on">{{ t('Full history', '全历史') }}</button>
